begin="2:23.230" end="2:23.652">天</span><span begin="2:23.652" end="2:24.437">会再</span><span begin="2:24.437" end="2:24.928">发</span><span begin="2:24.928" end="2:29.127">芽</span></p></div><div begin="2:55.308" end="3:20.661" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="2:55.308" end="3:01.105" itunes:key="L21" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:55.308" end="2:56.214">未来</span><span begin="2:56.214" end="2:56.951">迷人</span> <span begin="2:56.951" end="2:57.858">绚烂</span><span begin="2:57.858" end="2:58.680">总在</span><span begin="2:58.680" end="2:59.911">向我召</span><span begin="2:59.911" end="3:01.105">唤</span></p><p begin="3:00.298" end="3:04.665" itunes:key="L22" ttm:agent="v2000"><span begin="3:00.298" end="3:01.213">向我</span><span begin="3:01.213" end="3:01.597">召</span><span begin="3:01.597" end="3:04.665">唤</span></p><p begin="3:01.225" end="3:08.258" itunes:key="L23" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:01.225" end="3:02.864">哪怕只有</span><span begin="3:02.864" end="3:03.651">痛苦</span><span begin="3:03.651" end="3:05.325">作伴 也要</span><span begin="3:05.325" end="3:06.123">勇往</span><span begin="3:06.123" end="3:06.584">直</span><span begin="3:06.584" end="3:08.258">前</span></p><p begin="3:08.656" end="3:14.350" itunes:key="L24" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:08.656" end="3:10.364">我想在那</span><span begin="3:10.364" end="3:11.149">里最</span><span begin="3:11.149" end="3:11.970">蓝的</span><span begin="3:11.970" end="3:12.860">大海</span><span begin="3:12.860" end="3:13.238">扬</span><span begin="3:13.238" end="3:14.350">帆</span></p><p begin="3:13.723" end="3:17.735" itunes:key="L25" ttm:agent="v2000"><span begin="3:13.723" end="3:14.080">大</span><span begin="3:14.080" end="3:14.904">海扬</span><span begin="3:14.904" end="3:17.735">帆</span></p><p begin="3:14.510" end="3:20.661" itunes:key="L26" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:14.510" end="3:16.180">绝不管自</span><span begin="3:16.180" end="3:17.001">己能</span><span begin="3:17.001" end="3:17.757">不能</span><span begin="3:17.757" end="3:18.229">回</span><span